   {
    "heading": "Studies in 6/8",
    "paragraphs": [
     "In 6/8 the eighths must be played well separated and given equal value. So one must never drag on the third eighth of each beat. Dotted eighths, and eighths followed by sixteenths, are played in this rhythm following the same rules as in 2/4."
    ]
